    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Clicking on Zou Minglei’s social media page feels like walking into a national museum. The screen is suddenly filled with all kinds of ancient Chinese treasures. However, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of them are real—they’re all cakes. The young woman from Wuhan hopes to turn these ancient treasures "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " things people can feel and taste."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Zou always dreamt of opening her own dessert shop. After graduating "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " university, she began to study dessert-making seriously. In 2015, she started her own dessert "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "studio",
            "ref": "v-studio"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "turning point",
            "ref": "v-turning-point"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " came in 2018. That year, she made the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Marquis Yi Chime Bells",
            "zh": "曾侯乙编钟"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " into a cake and took "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to an international cake competition. She won a silver medal and impressed "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "bake"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from all over the world. Zou realised that traditional Chinese treasures could come to life in this sweet, modern way. As she said, “Our ancient treasures are beautiful and should not "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "forget"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This is a new way to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "preserve",
            "ref": "v-preserve"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and carry on our culture.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "By 2025, she "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "complete"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " 14 dessert "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "replicas",
            "zh": "复制品"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and received wide praise online. Her favourite piece is a replica of the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Fuhao Owl-Shaped Bronze Zun",
            "zh": "妇好鸮尊"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "create"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the Shang Dynasty, the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "original",
            "ref": "v-original"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is a bronze wine "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "container",
            "ref": "v-container"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the shape of an owl. Zou made its body from cake and the head and beak from "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "puffed rice grains",
            "zh": "膨化米粒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". For the patterns, Zou used "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fondant",
            "zh": "翻糖"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "icing",
            "zh": "糖霜"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Fans from all over the country have asked Zou "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "make"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " dessert replicas of ancient treasures from their cities. Their support has inspired her to keep building her “dessert museum”. She has even set a big goal for "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ": to create 100 replicas of ancient treasure desserts."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "We’re looking forward to the sweet surprises she will bring next!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
